From 6edf383af6da31a5be1c7a21f90fea6b5757c940 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:56:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] v31.4: no paid parents from search provenance;
 engagement-ranked parent discovery; analysis rebuild

- relevance_expansion: the 'provenance' parent tier is gone. Search Actors
  return off-query rows when real matches are scarce (run 20260925T094032Z:
  a Tsipras interview and a pastitsio video became paid Eurojackpot comment
  parents, 99 comments bought about nothing). An open parent must name the
  subject itself; operator pages keep their explicit tier.
- conversation-parent probe asks for engagement-ranked results (facebook
  searchType=top, tiktok sortType=MOST_LIKED, x queryType=Top) instead of
  newest, which surfaced syndicated bulletins with 0-1 comments.
- run_manager: analysis files missing at the intelligence stage (worker
  hand-off lost the workspace) -> rebuild the analysis once from the saved
  evidence instead of failing the run.
- tests: provenance reversal pins, LostAnalysisFilesTest, lifecycle fake
  writes the analysis file it claims to have produced.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FM9VfoHhfyZmxPfBDYfQjP
